WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:32.416 --> 00:00:35.666
Any update on the Jimmy...situation?

00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:39.916
Handled, my liege

00:00:39.916 --> 00:00:43.625
He is in good spirits and should
be returning to practice today

00:00:44.041 --> 00:00:47.500
Oh...so he no longer wants to be traded?

00:00:47.833 --> 00:00:50.833
Um...well...uh...we're working...ya know...

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.166
Who wants to DIE today???

00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:54.916
Ah, that must be him now

00:00:55.666 --> 00:00:57.041
KAT, do something!

00:00:57.041 --> 00:00:59.875
Don’t worry. He can’t do shit against me.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.916
I hope that means you worked on your defense

00:01:03.375 --> 00:01:05.750
I’ll take those two G Realm peasants, 

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.375
the muffin maker’s boy

00:01:07.375 --> 00:01:09.791
and that there mangy goat. 

00:01:09.791 --> 00:01:14.250
When they mop whatever’s left of you lily-livered cowards off the court,

00:01:14.375 --> 00:01:17.375
they’ll wish they traded me sooner!

00:01:17.875 --> 00:01:19.958
He doesn’t seem very happy

00:01:20.083 --> 00:01:21.375
Oh, that's just Jimmy

00:01:21.375 --> 00:01:24.958
Gotta love the intensity he brings...even to practice

00:01:24.958 --> 00:01:26.125
Hallelujah, Wiggins! 

00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:28.458
Should I send your bones to your brother???

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:30.375
No! Please, no!

00:01:30.375 --> 00:01:32.708
You f--king need me!

00:01:32.708 --> 00:01:33.583
Ah!!!

00:01:33.583 --> 00:01:36.500
Thibby, I just don’t have the stomach for this

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.041
This is the best practice all year

00:01:38.041 --> 00:01:39.750
Jimmy! Here! The Muffin Boy! I’m open!

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:41.750
He’s motivating them

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:44.791
We yield! We yield! Stop! Stop it, please!

00:01:44.791 --> 00:01:47.708
Aw, seems I’ve found the Towns Crier

00:01:47.708 --> 00:01:49.916
Hahaha!!!

00:01:49.916 --> 00:01:52.208
He’s slaughtering my little Timberpups

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.916
Oh, this was supposed to be our year!

00:01:54.916 --> 00:01:57.916
Hey you, get me a f--king salad! Balsamic dressing

00:01:59.416 --> 00:02:01.208
Actually, no dressing. I’ll use this.

00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:04.541
-Oh, dear god
-You just got served muffins and milk!

00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:05.666
As we said at House Bulls, 

00:02:05.666 --> 00:02:09.041
if you’re not mortally wounded, you can still play 48 minutes.

00:02:09.958 --> 00:02:12.375
Oh my goodness, is that Andrew’s heart?

00:02:12.625 --> 00:02:14.166
Nay. That’s too big.

00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:17.041
Pardon me, uh, have you seen my heart?

00:02:17.041 --> 00:02:18.583
Not now, Andrew!

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:22.208
Thomas, it might be time to admit this situation is untenable

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:25.083
What? It’s tenable. It's very tenable.

00:02:25.083 --> 00:02:29.791
It’s one of the most tenable situations I have ever...

00:02:29.791 --> 00:02:31.000
tended over

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:34.000
Curse these forsaken Twin Cities! 

00:02:34.375 --> 00:02:35.291
TRADE ME! 

00:02:35.291 --> 00:02:38.291
Remember, last season we were
a 3 seed before he got hurt

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.541
Curse this wretched house!

00:02:40.916 --> 00:02:41.833
TRADE ME!

00:02:41.833 --> 00:02:45.916
I swear this will all work out just fine if we’re just patient—

00:02:45.916 --> 00:02:48.000
And f--k you, Lord Thibodeau! 

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.791
Your rotations are shit!

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:55.166
Well, I do suppose I like Robert Covington’s hustle

00:02:57.583 --> 00:03:00.083
Oh, how exciting is this, Lord Commander?

00:03:00.083 --> 00:03:04.166
Jimmy can take us over the top! He could change everything with his intensity! 

00:03:04.166 --> 00:03:05.500
Oh, here he comes now!

00:03:06.458 --> 00:03:08.458
Is that a mini-carriage?

00:03:08.458 --> 00:03:10.416
He sure does have a lot of baggage

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.875
Um...I’d like to be traded, please

00:03:18.833 --> 00:03:22.666
Hello, city of Brotherly Love!!!

00:03:23.583 --> 00:03:25.833
Shall we complete this process now?

00:03:33.333 --> 00:03:35.666
Jimmy! Here! The Muffin Boy! I’m open!

00:03:37.333 --> 00:03:39.625
Yes! I just scored a three-pointer! 

00:03:39.625 --> 00:03:43.000
That feels better than a blueberry muffin on a Sunday morning with some milk!

00:03:45.416 --> 00:03:47.791
Haha! How do you like me muffins now?

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.500
You f--king need me!

00:03:52.833 --> 00:03:55.500
Jimmy! Nice! You just turned him into a muffin! 

00:03:56.416 --> 00:03:57.625
Take that!

00:03:57.625 --> 00:04:01.666
Blueberry muffins! And corn muffins! And chocolate chip muffins!

00:04:01.958 --> 00:04:05.666
Haha! I just put a muffin on his head!

00:04:07.375 --> 00:04:10.708
Hah! I know how to make muffins just like my dad!

00:04:12.041 --> 00:04:14.250
Good people of Youtube!

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:17.041
