00:04:17.041 --> 00:04:18.625
and click "SUBSCRIBE"

00:04:18.625 --> 00:04:20.416
It shows support for the show,

00:04:20.416 --> 00:04:23.708
and allows us to send you ravens when new episodes come out

00:04:23.708 --> 00:04:26.125
I want more episodes about Kobe!

00:04:26.125 --> 00:04:27.125
Yeah!

